    "estimand": "The causal effect of running specific offensive play type X (by 'your team') on the Points Per Possession (PPP) of the immediate subsequent possession by the opponent, and the causal effect of 'own-sequence lags' (defined as the PPP of the immediately preceding offensive possession by 'your team') on the PPP of the current possession. These effects will be quantified as differences in PPP relative to a baseline or control group, and then assessed for their magnitude and consistency to determine if they are 'large enough to drive AVOID labels'.",
